    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'WASD / ARROWS drive     SHIFT nitro     CTRL drift

    SPACE class attack    
    C station charge     M map     G cosmetic shop     ESC pause


    Choose Nightjar
    (fast slash), Bison (heavy slam), or Kestrel (balanced pulse).

    Level 3:
    Q class special. Level 5: E class finisher.

    Clear a new city to earn a garage
    point: unlock R dash, combat skills, or cargo attraction.


    Follow radio
    beacons in order within 45 seconds to charge CITY RESONANCE.

    F releases
    it: Nightjar escapes, Bison gains armor, Kestrel commands a green wave.

    Red
    danger rings warn you before enemy attacks. Leave the circle to dodge.

    Traffic
    signals, turn indicators, curved avenues and roundabouts shape each route.'
